# Fell's "target creature" is any creature, the caster's included (CR 701.8a): Bot1 destroys its own Memnite and Bot2's creature is left alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Memnite
Fell
Swamp x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fell.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Fell; Memnite
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
